# Phase 133 (Visual Atlas Preview) D-07 masking scan: the local pattern-list
# file the scan reads via MASKING_SCAN_PATTERNS_FILE. Repo-root-anchored
# (`/.masking_patterns`, NOT the filesystem root `/`); mirrors the
# PUZZLE_UPLOAD_SECRET env-sourced-secret posture. NEVER commit this file.
/.masking_patterns

# Phase 133 baked atlas asset (offline bake output). Lives OUTSIDE web/static/
# on purpose -- the /static mount at web/main.py:740 serves web/static/
# publicly, which would let the asset bypass the atlas-preview feature flag.
# scp'd to the server like the other sidecar DBs; never committed.
/atlas_data/
